"HarmonyOS NEXT（原生鸿蒙）": ["HarmonyOS NEXT (nativo)","HarmonyOS NEXT (native)"],
"安卓版本": ["Versione Android","Android version"],
"系统版本待核对": ["Versione da verificare","System version needs checking"],
